---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Wen Bin, a software engineer based in Singapore."
>
  <article aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h1 id="about-title" class="mb-2">About</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 text-base leading-[1.55] text-black">
      Hi! I’m Wen Bin - you can call me David, I'm a software engineer based in
      Singapore.
    </p>
    <br />
    <p>
      I currently work at <a target="_blank" href="https://www.trustana.com"
        >Trustana</a
      >, where I build software for retailers like Toys'R'Us, Harvey Norman,
      David Jones etc to manage and optimize data of 100K - 1M products a month.
    </p>
    <figure class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
      <img
        class="mx-auto mt-5 block aspect-square w-full max-w-[320px] rounded-[3px] object-cover"
        src="/profile_pic.png"
        alt="Wen Bin by the water at sunset"
        width="400"
        height="400"
      />
      <figcaption class="text-xs max-w-1/3 text-center">
        Picture of me generated using a custom FLUX workflow via ComfyUI
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="mt-6" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
      <p class="mb-3 text-base leading-[1.55] text-black">
        I'm trying to write about topics and work that are representative of
        what I like: complex components and deep ends into system designs.
      </p>
      {
        (
          <ol class="m-0 pl-6 text-base leading-[1.55] text-black">
            <li>Nothing yet</li>
          </ol>
        )
      }
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
